Rule 2 (tensor has a valid rank; all dimensions are non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0 ∧ if ndim(v_1) > 0 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 3 (name, when provided, is a string)
{v_1 : str} |= v_1 = v_1
